      "text": "Day 1 · Arrival at Rio de Janeiro Airport, meeting and transfer to the hotel. Free time. Rio is green hills, blue skies, rocky peaks, coves, islands and beautiful beaches: Brazil’s second-largest city and one of the most beautiful in the world. At nightfall, the hillside lights encircle the city like a shimmering necklace.",
