    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ed16a4a6402062c304082d0ae6a96ba09a7f2c2a258084c26b28473a5062eac7",
      "text": "Day 2 · Breakfast, then a 4-hour tour: the cable car to Morro da Urca, with its wide observation deck, and on to Sugar Loaf, with views of Copacabana, the bay, the islands, the bridge to Niterói and Christ the Redeemer, then old Rio, with its historic churches, monasteries, Metropolitan Cathedral and colonial buildings.\n\nOptional · A helicopter flight over Rio, from USD 230, and dinner at Fogo de Chão, the Brazilian steakhouse overlooking Sugar Loaf (around USD 75).",
